            <ArticleTitle>[Acute myocardial infarct and coronary artery aneurysm during pregnancy].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>47-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We present the first published case in Spain on a gestant woman with acute myocardial infarction. She was angiographically studied showing a coronary artery aneurysm with inner thrombus. This is also the first time that such a lesion is described in vivo in a gestant woman.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
